231 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/P/E(Many have found the concept of an AI influencer fascinating. Followers engage as though she is real, and many are unaware that she is an AI at first glance. Celebrities even reach out, unaware of this fact. Many sceptics doubt whether AI-generated personas and identities can truly connect with audiences on a personal level. )/Pg 17 0 R/K[2]/P 79 0 R>>
endobj

