240 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/H1/T(HOW AI WORLD MODELS COULD TRANSFORM INDIE GAME DEVELOPMENT)/E(HOW AI WORLD MODELS COULD TRANSFORM INDIE GAME DEVELOPMENT)/Pg 18 0 R/K[0]/P 80 0 R>>
endobj

241 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/P/E(Imagine typing a single prompt and watching it transform into a fully playable game in seconds. This futuristic concept is a reality thanks to Google DeepMind's latest innovation, Genie 2. Genie 2 can generate a diverse 3D environment based on the user's prompt, object interactions, character animations, and interactable NPCs, all based on that environment. Any gamer who desires a niche location that has not been explored can now explore that world all with a simple prompt; for developers, it streamlines a large amount of work by enabling rapid prototypes of game worlds, drastically reducing the cost and time burdens that often come with video game creation. )/Pg 18 0 R/K[1]/P 80 0 R>>
endobj

242 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/P/E(Indie studios, in particular, could use this to their advantage by generating otherwise costly and time-consuming environments, allowing them to compete with much larger studios. )/Pg 18 0 R/K[2]/P 80 0 R>>
endobj

243 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/P/E(AI streamlining character dialogue is one area that has already been experimented with, particularly with the game Inworld Origins. This game utilised generated text-based AI for the story of a crime scene, encouraging players to interact with NPCs to uncover clues. Although the dialogue often yielded mixed results, it still serves as an example of how indie companies could leverage AI to provide better experiences to users. )/Pg 18 0 R/K[3]/P 80 0 R>>
endobj

244 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/P/E(AI's incorporation in video games is currently in its infancy; however, on a larger scale, this technology could provide a truly unique experience that tailors itself to the user's playstyle, providing unlimited replayability and unlimited outcomes. AI could assist in map development and dialogue. With increasingly improved generative AI, it could stretch into soundtracks, sound effects, voice acting, animation, asset creation, and more. )/Pg 18 0 R/K[4]/P 80 0 R>>
endobj

245 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/P/E(Questions still circulate about how this could affect the gaming industry in the near future, either as a tool or as a replacement for many job positions. )/Pg 18 0 R/K[5]/P 80 0 R>>
endobj

