264 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/P/E(An AI cofounder refers to an AI contributing to the foundational work of startups, from market research to strategy, assisting in the burdensome process of startup creation. Startups are increasingly relying on AI to reduce costs, scale quicker, and gain a competitive edge, making AI a crucial part of their journey. )/Alt()/Pg 20 0 R/K[0]/P 82 0 R>>
endobj

265 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/P/E(AI, for example, can be invaluable in market research. Its ability to analyse patterns and market trends can help identify untapped opportunities and give startups a significant advantage. Product development was once a slow hurdle, but with generative AI, prototypes and visuals for specified needs can be created in an instant. )/Alt()/Pg 20 0 R/K[1]/P 82 0 R>>
endobj

266 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/P/E(With AI seamlessly integrating into many of these foundational processes, it's no surprise that it has become a cornerstone of modern startup success. It contributes in minor or major areas to enable more cost-efficient scaling, a major concern for startups. As the technology evolves, the role will undoubtedly expand, continuing to empower startups to turn bold ideas into a reality at an unprecedented pace. )/Alt()/Pg 20 0 R/K[2]/P 82 0 R>>
endobj

