274 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/H2/T(AI-driven startups like these highlight the diversity of applications that artificial intelligence is revolutionising. They impact more than just AI models themselves; from recycling to robotics, these startups are paving the way for an AI-powered tomorrow. )/E(AI-driven startups like these highlight the diversity of applications that artificial intelligence is revolutionising. They impact more than just AI models themselves; from recycling to robotics, these startups are paving the way for an AI-powered tomorrow. )/Alt()/Pg 21 0 R/K[0]/P 83 0 R>>
endobj

275 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/H5/T(Tractable Automated damage assessment Tractable uses computer vision technology to transform the insurance industry. Their AI analyses vehicle or property damage images, providing instant repair cost estimates and accelerating the claims process. Founded in 2014, the company has become a trusted partner for global insurers. By 2024, Tractable's AI is streamlining claims and expanding into new markets, including disaster recovery, making it a leader in applying AI to practical, high-stakes scenarios.)/E(Tractable Automated damage assessment Tractable uses computer vision technology to transform the insurance industry. Their AI analyses vehicle or property damage images, providing instant repair cost estimates and accelerating the claims process. Founded in 2014, the company has become a trusted partner for global insurers. By 2024, Tractable's AI is streamlining claims and expanding into new markets, including disaster recovery, making it a leader in applying AI to practical, high-stakes scenarios.)/Alt()/Pg 21 0 R/K[4]/P 83 0 R>>
endobj

276 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/H5/T(Recursion AI-driven drug discovery Recursion \(formerly Exscientia\) was founded in 2012 and has increasingly pushed the boundaries of traditional drug discovery by using AI to design and optimise new medicines. The company's AI platform analyses the efficiency and effects drugs will have on the human body, significantly reducing development time and costs. As of 2024, Exscientia launched the EXCYTE-2 trial to use AI to predict drug responses for better acute myeloid leukaemia \(AML\) treatment, showing how AI is being implemented to assist in adopting better medicine. )/E(Recursion AI-driven drug discovery Recursion \(formerly Exscientia\) was founded in 2012 and has increasingly pushed the boundaries of traditional drug discovery by using AI to design and optimise new medicines. The company's AI platform analyses the efficiency and effects drugs will have on the human body, significantly reducing development time and costs. As of 2024, Exscientia launched the EXCYTE-2 trial to use AI to predict drug responses for better acute myeloid leukaemia \(AML\) treatment, showing how AI is being implemented to assist in adopting better medicine. )/Alt()/Pg 21 0 R/K[3]/P 83 0 R>>
endobj

277 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/H5/T(PlayHT Voice Meets Innovation PlayHT platforms use AI text-to-speech models to provide natural-sounding speech for its customers. These platforms cover a wide range of needs, from podcasts to e-learning material supporting the needs of other companies. Supporting over 900 languages in 142 languages, they offer practical tools for businesses looking to integrate audio into their workforces. )/E(PlayHT Voice Meets Innovation PlayHT platforms use AI text-to-speech models to provide natural-sounding speech for its customers. These platforms cover a wide range of needs, from podcasts to e-learning material supporting the needs of other companies. Supporting over 900 languages in 142 languages, they offer practical tools for businesses looking to integrate audio into their workforces. )/Alt()/Pg 21 0 R/K[5]/P 83 0 R>>
endobj

278 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/H5/T(AMP Robotics  AI in recycling  AMP Robotics incorporates AI into the recycling process through automation in the sorting and categorising waste materials to improve efficiency, reduce the need for human labour, and streamline the recycling process, a necessary step in tackling environmental challenges.   )/E(AMP Robotics  AI in recycling  AMP Robotics incorporates AI into the recycling process through automation in the sorting and categorising waste materials to improve efficiency, reduce the need for human labour, and streamline the recycling process, a necessary step in tackling environmental challenges.   )/Alt()/Pg 21 0 R/K[6]/P 83 0 R>>
endobj

