287 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/H1/T(AI-DRIVEN SCAMS: THE RISING THREAT OF VOICE CLONING AND DEEPFAKES)/E(AI-DRIVEN SCAMS: THE RISING THREAT OF VOICE CLONING AND DEEPFAKES)/Pg 22 0 R/K[4]/P 84 0 R>>
endobj

288 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/P/E(As advancements in voice cloning and video generation advance, new risks and opportunities for exploitation are introduced. An individual needs only a few seconds of spoken audio from an individual to close the person's voice; combined with the generally low quality of phone calls, distinguishing AI from a person is getting harder as these models advance. These scammers then ask for money from an individual; unlike regular scams, these AI scams thrive from the fact that many people are unaware this technology even exists or is possible for them; awareness is the biggest method of prevention by simulating a loved one in a desperate situation, scammers thrive off urgency. )/Alt()/Pg 22 0 R/K[0]/P 84 0 R>>
endobj

289 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/P/E(Another increasingly common scam is deepfakes. Deepfakes simulate audio and video using AI models; scammers use AI to replicate an individual's voice and appearance, making them do or say things before the threat of being posted online. Deepfakes are a growing threat as AI technology creates an increasingly indistinguishable line between real and fictional. Scammers can fabricate scenarios of an individual that can result in blackmail.)/Alt()/Pg 22 0 R/K[1]/P 84 0 R>>
endobj

290 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/P/E(The ease of creating deepfakes with publicly available content makes them especially dangerous. As this technology advances, distinguishing fake from real becomes harder, eroding trust in audio and video evidence. Awareness and education are critical in recognising and combating this growing threat.)/Alt()/Pg 22 0 R/K[2]/P 84 0 R>>
endobj

291 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/P/E(The ease of creating deepfakes makes them especially dangerous, and the advancement of this technology would result in an erosion of trust or confusion regarding the validity of audio and video evidence. Awareness of recent AI advancements and scams is crucial in combating this growing threat. )/Alt()/Pg 22 0 R/K[3]/P 84 0 R>>
endobj

