301 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/H4/T(1.\) Establishing a code or phrase that you and a loved one are aware of can be a simple but very effective method; it is free and simple and could make the difference in confirming an identity or unexpected or suspicious event. Otherwise, asking for personal information at the moment \(such as pet names or street names\) can be sufficient. )/E(1.\) Establishing a code or phrase that you and a loved one are aware of can be a simple but very effective method; it is free and simple and could make the difference in confirming an identity or unexpected or suspicious event. Otherwise, asking for personal information at the moment \(such as pet names or street names\) can be sufficient. )/Alt()/Pg 23 0 R/K[0]/P 85 0 R>>
endobj

302 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/H4/T(2.\) Be aware of your online footprints Being mindful of the personal content you upload online is a practical habit even outside of AI scams; identity theft prevention and maintaining a professional reputation are solid reasons to take care of your online footprints. Scammers thrive off your audio recordings, images, and videos to feed to models to replicate you; restricting access to this content reduces exposure)/E(2.\) Be aware of your online footprints Being mindful of the personal content you upload online is a practical habit even outside of AI scams; identity theft prevention and maintaining a professional reputation are solid reasons to take care of your online footprints. Scammers thrive off your audio recordings, images, and videos to feed to models to replicate you; restricting access to this content reduces exposure)/Alt()/Pg 23 0 R/K[3]/P 85 0 R>>
endobj

303 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/H4/T(3 Stay familiar with AI tools and emerging technology: Familiarise yourself with emerging AI tools and technology. By understanding the technology and how it can be misused, you can help prevent potential scams and take any necessary preventative measures.)/E(3 Stay familiar with AI tools and emerging technology: Familiarise yourself with emerging AI tools and technology. By understanding the technology and how it can be misused, you can help prevent potential scams and take any necessary preventative measures.)/Alt()/Pg 23 0 R/K[4]/P 85 0 R>>
