320 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/H1/T(THE MIND OF MACHINES: UNDERSTANDING THE LIMITS OF AI LEARNING)/E(THE MIND OF MACHINES: UNDERSTANDING THE LIMITS OF AI LEARNING)/Pg 25 0 R/K[7]/P 87 0 R>>
endobj

321 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/Figure/P 87 0 R/Pg 25 0 R/K[12]>>
